{
    "background_story": "Kasen was a street-smart rat who lived in the sewers beneath the city. His tattered fur and scrawny physique earned him the nickname 'Ratty' among the other rodents. Despite his rough appearance, Kasen had a keen mind and a talent for scavenging. He could sniff out the tastiest scraps and most valuable trinkets in the darkest alleys. Kasen's ratty nature also made him resourceful and quick-witted, able to evade the city's pesky exterminators with ease. At night, he'd sneak into the local market, dodging brooms and curious cats to gather food for his makeshift family of orphaned rats. Kasen's ratty exterior hid a heart of gold, and his cunning nature kept his loved ones safe and fed in the harsh underground world.",
